
Numera aʻoaʻo: ['plus:'] o-lona-uiga: ['+'].
Numera pe-a-oo-mai: ['+'] fai: { :x
	>> rate := 1.
	>> currency := x iunite-numera.
	(currency = ['euros']) moni: {
		rate := 2.
	}. <- (ia-lava plus: (x × rate)).
}.
>> dollars := 3.
>> euros := 2.
dollars iunite: ['dollars'].
euros iunite: ['euros'].
>> money := dollars + euros.
Tuuina-atu tusi: money, laina-fou.
